{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1355.unity3d","item_key":"commands[8].text","source_sha256":"6d6fc6909d1297f31cb6eb583202c5e84e112542182e0dccd589e55dabc4bdb2","ja":"な、何か問題でもあるかな？","zh":"","status":"untranslated","translation_stage":"untranslated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T06:48:16+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1355.unity3d","item_key":"commands[9].text","source_sha256":"cd9f6bf93f63b60b3111ed2b50d1ef12586431fb5481606d47d3d4ef41ffa91e","ja":"い、いえ、問題は別に。\nただ、風花さんって、意外と積極的なんだなって……。","zh":"","status":"untranslated","translation_stage":"untranslated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T06:48:16+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1355.unity3d","item_key":"commands[10].text","source_sha256":"50199cf72d88100c6b6bfbf6669593668f7672e4c822c2e64f5166fff7895527","ja":"その、ふたりっきりでいる時間とスポットが\n多かったので……。","zh":"","status":"untranslated","translation_stage":"untranslated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T06:48:16+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1355.unity3d","item_key":"commands[11].text","source_sha256":"9c6c3e0efcf975749fa3a2a001e485ed446beafa63ab99cc7e50d6ece196d252","ja":"え、あ、それは……大人ならきっと、仕事であまり\n会えなくて、そういう時間が欲しいかなって……。","zh":"","status":"untranslated","translation_stage":"untranslated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T06:48:16+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1355.unity3d","item_key":"commands[12].text","source_sha256":"4041870e67c8aae5fef9a60574819c807a6301af986ea899d69943a3cf7b2e41","ja":"こ、こんなに積極的だと志保ちゃんも恥かしいよね！\nでもスタッフさんにもこのルート伝えちゃったし……。","zh":"","status":"untranslated","translation_stage":"untranslated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T06:48:16+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1355.unity3d","item_key":"commands[13].text","source_sha256":"ba9e5df384ddceac339e3e5eee4572dd0d2731b51cb8548c4caef2e6cf7bbf67","ja":"「北沢さん、豊川さん！\nそろそろスタンバイお願いしまーす！」","zh":"","status":"untranslated","translation_stage":"untranslated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T06:48:16+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1355.unity3d","item_key":"commands[14].text","source_sha256":"b6f29fd38614e21323a8cbb7cc7ffd85e6691b8920dcefbf4bd857ba592e69a6","ja":"風花さん、大丈夫です。\n撮影が始まりますし行きましょう……いえ。","zh":"","status":"untranslated","translation_stage":"untranslated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T06:48:16+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1355.unity3d","item_key":"commands[15].text","source_sha256":"71a93e709d96361ddc06f7b8549be5155e8a3a9b10ea0f18431347314147671d","ja":"「それじゃあ祥子。きみの決めたデートコース、\nふたりで一緒に楽しもうか」","zh":"","status":"untranslated","translation_stage":"untranslated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T06:48:16+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1355.unity3d","item_key":"commands[16].text","source_sha256":"81cc7e4426d31dd0a29a270f582950d474556a7ec9759b76d386cbbbf15b952f","ja":"えっ、ええええっ……！？\nし、志保ちゃん……！？","zh":"","status":"untranslated","translation_stage":"untranslated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T06:48:16+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1355.unity3d","item_key":"commands[17].text","source_sha256":"b9182e993b94ff0b9bef0ba76592b2bb686bf51b9b507679abffb37c6d494331","ja":"そ、そんなに驚かないでください。\nわ、私まで恥ずかしくなりますから……。","zh":"","status":"untranslated","translation_stage":"untranslated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T06:48:16+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1355.unity3d","item_key":"commands[18].text","source_sha256":"0c656c8dee4ef0ce5ccf12eda6dbefedd04c3ed75c81dbb52e0497de8778d96f","ja":"風花さんが素敵なデートコースを考えてくれたから、\n今度は私が彼氏役としてひっぱらないとって……。","zh":"","status":"untranslated","translation_stage":"untranslated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T06:48:16+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1355.unity3d","item_key":"commands[19].text","source_sha256":"75ac5400f5d7956cd89e266f3f5d9d22fdd8df3ae8a21ce7f6835a865f6d43e8","ja":"と、とにかく……「さぁ、少し歩こうか。\nほら、早く僕の腕に手を回して」","zh":"","status":"untranslated","translation_stage":"untranslated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T06:48:16+00:00"}
